L1: Effects of Exercise Alone or Combined With Cognitive Training and Vitamin D Supplementation to Improve Cognition in Adults With Mild Cognitive Impairment
L2: JAMA Network Open (2023)
L3: Manuel Montero-Odasso, Guangyong Zou, Mark Speechley, Quincy J. Almeida, Teresa Liu-Ambrose, Laura E. Middleton, Richard Camicioli, Nick W. Bray, Karen Z. H. Li, Sarah Fraser, Frederico Pieruccini-Faria, Nicolas Berryman, Maxime Lussier, J. Kevin Shoemaker, Surim Son, Louis Bherer
L4: 1 Gait and Brain Lab, Parkwood Institute, Lawson Health Research Institute, London, Ontario, Canada
L5: 2 Department of Medicine, Division of Geriatric, Schulich School of Medicine and Dentistry, University of Western Ontario, London, Ontario, Canada
