L640: |---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
L641: |Weeks|Day<br>1|Day<br>2|Day<br>3|Day 1|Day 2|Day 3|Day 3|
L642: |1-4|2|2|2|15-18|15-18|15-18|30|
L643: |5-8<br>|3 <br>|2 <br>|3 <br>|12-15<br>|12-15<br>|12-15<br>|30<br>|
L644: |9-12|3|2|3|10|10|10|60|
L645: |13-16|2|3|2|8|12|8|60|
L646: |17-20|3|2|3|6|8|6|60|
L647: Following the strength portion of each session, an aerobic training will be prescribed. Participants will
L648: be asked to complete 10-20 minutes of cardiovascular exercises using different ergometers (treadmill,
L649: elliptical machines, cycling ergometers, rowing machines etc.), using steps or other forms of free aerobic
L650: exercises, as long as the cognitive load is minimized. Intensity will be monitored using a Borg scale (0
L651: 10) and the target will correspond to 5-6 for the first month, 6-7 for the second month and 7-8 for the
L652: last month. Details of the aerobic training are presented in the table below. Each session will end with a
L653: five (5) minute recovery period, which will consist of different breathing exercises and stretching.
