L1821: SYNERGIC Trial                                                    Statistical Analyses Plan
L1822: ## 292 12. Programming Plans
L1823: 293 Data analysis will be performed using statistical software SPSS (SPSS version 23.0,
L1824: 294 SPSS Inc., Chicago, IL) and R version 3.5.1 (R Project for Statistical Computing).
